<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#11171c"><title>Character Lab / Mutant Dojo</title></head>
<body><div class="lab-shell">
<header class="lab-header"><a class="brand" href="/">MD<span>CHARACTER LAB</span></a><span class="header-note">MAKE EVERY FRAME COUNT.</span><div class="header-actions"><a href="/motion.html">RIG & MOTION</a><span id="save-state">PRESET LOADED</span><button id="save">SAVE PRESET</button><a href="/">OPEN DOJO ↗</a></div></header>
<aside class="rail"><div class="section-label">01 / SUBJECT</div><button class="subject active" data-character="leonardo"><i class="blue"></i><span><b>LEONARDO</b><small>DUAL KATANAS</small></span><em>01</em></button><button class="subject" data-character="raphael"><i class="red"></i><span><b>RAPHAEL</b><small>DUAL SAI</small></span><em>02</em></button>
<div class="section-label spaced">LEO / SPRITE STUDIES</div><div class="clips reference-clips"><button class="active" data-clip="leo-ready"><span>Ready stance</span><small>R7</small></button><button data-clip="leo-overhead"><span>Overhead guard / cut</span><small>R1</small></button><button data-clip="leo-knee-slash"><span>Raised-knee slash</span><small>R2/4</small></button><button data-clip="leo-high-kick"><span>High kick</span><small>R3</small></button><button data-clip="leo-airborne"><span>Airborne sideways</span><small>R5</small></button><button data-clip="leo-grounded"><span>Grounded / recovery</span><small>R6</small></button></div>
<div class="section-label spaced">02 / ACTION LIBRARY</div><div class="clips"><button data-clip="idle"><span>Idle / Guard</span><small>01</small></button><button data-clip="walk"><span>Forward step</span><small>02</small></button><button data-clip="backstep"><span>Backward step</span><small>02B</small></button><button data-clip="jump"><span>Jump</span><small>03</small></button><button data-clip="strike"><span>Straight punch</span><small>04</small></button><button data-clip="heavy"><span>Heavy strike</span><small>05</small></button><button data-clip="block"><span>High guard / Block</span><small>06</small></button><button data-clip="crouch"><span>Crouch</span><small>06B</small></button><button data-clip="hit"><span>Hit reaction</span><small>07</small></button></div>
<div class="rail-bottom"><div class="section-label">03 / CONTACT TEST</div><button id="training">TEST AGAINST DUMMY</button><p>A / D move · W jump<br>F punch · G heavy · S block · C crouch</p><p>PAD: Stick / D-pad move + crouch<br>A / Cross jump · X / Square punch<br>Y / Triangle heavy · LB / L1 block<br>Start / Options: enter training / pause</p><p class="fine">Current animations use rigid Blender pivots. This lab is the workbench for the next character and animation passes.</p></div></aside>
<main class="workspace"><div class="viewport-wrap"><canvas id="lab-canvas" tabindex="0" aria-label="Interactive character viewport"></canvas><div class="viewport-heading"><span class="live-dot"></span><b id="subject-name">LEONARDO</b><span id="view-mode">MOTION PREVIEW</span></div><div id="load-status" role="status">Loading Blender character assets...</div><div class="camera-tools" aria-label="Camera presets"><button data-camera="front">FRONT</button><button data-camera="side">SIDE</button><button data-camera="back">BACK</button><button data-camera="three">¾ VIEW</button></div><div class="viewport-foot"><span>DRAG TO ORBIT · SCROLL TO ZOOM · RIGHT DRAG TO PAN</span><button id="capture">SAVE IMAGE</button></div><div class="telemetry"><span id="phase">IDLE</span><b id="frame-display">000 / 120</b><small id="contact-info">NO CONTACT YET</small><small id="health-info" hidden></small></div></div>
<section class="transport"><div class="transport-top"><div><button id="play" aria-label="Pause playback">Ⅱ</button><button id="step" aria-label="Advance one frame">STEP +1</button><button id="restart">RESTART</button></div><strong id="clip-name">IDLE / GUARD</strong><div class="transport-options"><label><input id="loop" type="checkbox" checked> LOOP</label><select id="speed" aria-label="Playback speed"><option value=".1">0.1× SPEED</option><option value=".25">0.25× SPEED</option><option value=".5">0.5× SPEED</option><option value="1" selected>1× SPEED</option></select></div></div><div id="phase-track" class="phase-track"><span class="startup">PREVIEW</span></div><input id="scrub" class="scrubber" type="range" min="0" max="120" step="1" value="0" aria-label="Animation frame"><div class="transport-bottom"><span id="timing-description">120 FRAMES · 60 FPS</span><span>SPACE: PLAY / PAUSE · →: STEP WHEN PAUSED</span></div></section></main>
<aside class="inspector"><div class="tabs"><button class="active" data-tab="motion">MOTION</button><button data-tab="attacks">ATTACKS</button><button data-tab="appearance">LOOK</button></div><div class="inspector-content"><section id="reference-study"><h3>LEO / SOURCE REFERENCE</h3><div id="reference-images"></div><p id="reference-note" class="fine"></p><button id="reference-frame">HOLD REFERENCE FRAME</button><div id="reference-fields"></div></section><section id="panel-motion" class="panel"><h2>Movement & stance</h2><p class="panel-note">Preview the pose, then test its timing in motion.</p><div id="motion-fields"></div></section><section id="panel-attacks" class="panel" hidden><h2>Attack authoring</h2><p class="panel-note">Timings are measured at 60 simulation frames per second.</p><div class="attack-select"><button class="active" data-attack="strike">LIGHT</button><button data-attack="heavy">HEAVY</button></div><div id="attack-fields"></div><p class="fine">Timing changes apply to the next attack. The range guide visualizes the current distance check.</p></section><section id="panel-appearance" class="panel" hidden><h2>Silhouette & surface</h2><p class="panel-note">Test proportions and palette before the next Blender sculpt.</p><div id="appearance-fields"></div><div class="colors"><label>SKIN TINT<input id="skin-color" type="color"></label><label>MASK TINT<input id="mask-color" type="color"></label></div><p class="fine">Colors tint the existing texture. Proportion controls transform model groups.</p></section>
<section class="scene-settings"><h3>VIEWPORT</h3><label class="select-row">Environment<select id="environment"><option value="studio">STUDIO</option><option value="rooftop">ROOFTOP</option></select></label><label class="select-row">Lighting<select id="lighting"><option value="studio">SOFT STUDIO</option><option value="cinematic">NIGHT / JADE</option><option value="flat">NEUTRAL</option></select></label><div class="toggles"><label><input id="wireframe" type="checkbox"> Wireframe</label><label><input id="pivots" type="checkbox"> Animation pivots</label><label><input id="ranges" type="checkbox" checked> Contact guides</label><label><input id="grid" type="checkbox" checked> Floor grid</label><label><input id="weapons" type="checkbox" checked> Show weapons</label></div></section>
<section id="dummy-settings" hidden><h3>TRAINING TARGET</h3><label class="select-row">Behavior<select id="dummy-mode"><option value="idle">IDLE</option><option value="block">BLOCK</option><option value="counter">STRIKE BACK</option></select></label><label class="select-row">Starting gap<input id="distance" type="number" min="1.2" max="5" step=".1" value="1.65"></label><button id="reset-target">RESET SPACING & HEALTH</button><div id="hit-log" aria-live="polite"><p>No hits recorded.</p></div></section>
<section class="preset-tools"><h3>PRESETS</h3><div><button id="export">EXPORT JSON</button><label class="import-button">IMPORT JSON<input id="import" type="file" accept="application/json,.json" hidden></label></div><button id="defaults">RESET SELECTED CHARACTER</button><p class="fine">Save stores both characters in this browser. Reload the dojo to use the saved tuning.</p></section></div><p id="notice" role="status">Ready to refine.</p></aside>
</div><script type="module" src="/src/lab.js"></script></body></html>

